 36MG c  With the identification of g.s. and first 2+ state as intruder levels  
 36MG2c  (2007Ga34), this nuclide has been characterized as situated in the so  
 36MG3c  called 'island of inversion'.                                          
 36MG c  Mass measurements: 2007Ju03, 2000Sa21 (also 2001Sa72)                  
 36MG c  Other measurements:                                                    
 36MG c  1989Gu03: {+181}Ta({+48}Ca,X) E=55 MeV/nucleon, GANIL. Particle        
 36MG2c  stability of {+36}Mg first established.                                
 36MG c  1999YoZW: {+9}Be,{+181}Ta({+48}Ca,X) E=70 MeV/nucleon, RIKEN. Measured 
 36MG2c  half-life, %|b{+-}n, very preliminary results.                         
 36MG d  In an e-mail reply to B. Singh of Dec 2000, first author of 1999YoZW   
 36MG2d  stated that values in their report 1999YoZW are very preliminary and   
 36MG3d  should not be adopted. No subsequent publication has appeared from this
 36MG4d  group                                                                  
 36MG c  2007Ta15: {+9}Be,W({+48}Ca,X), measured production cross section       
 36MG c  2007Ga34: {+9}Be({+38}Si,X|g), established intruder character of g.s.  
 36MG2c  and first excited 2+ state at NSCL                                     
 36MG d  Structure calculations (selected references): 2009No01, 2009Yo06,      
 36MG2d  2006Ha28, 2006Zh19: calculated levels, deformation, etc.               
