 36MG6c  spectrometer. Measured E|g, I|g, {+36}Mg-|g-coin, |s. Deduced B(E2)    
 36MG7c  from data for Pb target (dominated by Coulomb excitation) and          
 36MG8c  deformation length from data for carbon target (dominated by nuclear   
 36MG9c  inelastic scattering) by comparing the measured cross sections to those
 36MGAc  calculated by ECIS97 coupled-channel code using the rotational model.  
