 36S  c  Isotope discovery (2012Th10): {+36}S isotope was identified in a mass  
 36S 2c  spectrometer at Harvard (1938Ni04).                                    
 36S  c  {+36}S production:                                                     
 36S  c  2012Zh06: {+9}Be({+40}Ar,X) E=57 MeV/nucleon, measured fragment yields.
 36S  c  2008IdZZ: {+24}Mg({+18}O,x|g) E=70 MeV, measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin.  
 36S  c  2003Wa23: {+36}Cl(n,p){+36}S at E=0.1-350 keV, measured |s.            
 36S  c  2002Go28: {+39}Ar(n,|g){+36}S, E=thermal, measured |s upper limit.     
 36S  c  2001Go29: {+39}Ar(n,|g){+36}S at E<100 keV, Maxwellian-averaged |s.    
 36S  c  1985Ko43: {+20}Ne({+16}O,{+16}O') at E(c.m.)=24.5-35.5 MeV; deduced    
 36S 2c  resonances.                                                            
 36S  c  1985Gy02, 1985GyZZ: {+36}S(|p-,|p-) E=48.4 MeV, measured |s(|q).       
 36S  c  1971Ar32: {+232}Th({+40}Ar,X) at E=290 MeV, measured yields.           
 36S  c  {+36}S radius measurements:                                            
 36S  c  1985Sc05: measured muonic x-ray energies, deduced rms charge radii.    
 36S  c  1983Ry04: measured |s(|q) in {+36}S(e,e) at E=120, 240, 320 MeV;       
 36S 2c  deduced charge radius.                                                 
 36S  c  {+36}S mass measurements:                                              
 36S  c  2001Wa50: mass differences and binding energies from {+36}S(p,n) at    
 36S 2c  E|?=2 MeV and {+36}Cl(n,p) reactions.                                  
 36S  d  Theoretical calculations:                                              
 36S  d  2023Ch34: ab initio interactions, levels, J, |p and moments.           
 36S  d  2023Dr01: shell model (ZBM2, USDB, sdpfu-mix, GXPF1A), 2+ level and    
 36S 2d  B(E2) in {+36}S.                                                       
 36S  d  2023Fo05: shell model, B(E2), B(M1) and transition matrix elements.    
 36S  d  2018Va09: shell model (sdpfu-mix), levels, J, |p; mirror energy        
 36S 2d  differences in {+36}Ca-{+36}S.                                         
 36S  d  2017Bo18: shell model (PSDPF), levels, J, |p, B(E2), and B(E3).        
 36S  d  2017Bo20: shell model (PSDPF), 2+ and 3- levels, B(E2) and B(E3).      
 36S  d  2017De15: HF+BCS+QRPA (Gogny), 1-, 2+, 3- energies, B(E2), B(M1).      
 36S  d  2016Si02: ab initio, first 2+ levels, S(2n), S(2p), uncertainties.     
 36S  d  2009Bo30: shell model (PSDPFB), negative-parity intruder levels, J, |p.
 36S  d  2006St21: shell model, level energies, g factors, B(E2), deformation.  
 36S  d  2006In01: self-consistent RPA, spins, octupole strengths.              
