 36S 5c  surface-barrier detector telescope (FWHM=110 keV). For {+3}He ions     
 36S 6c  reaction angles |q>12|', they were detected by Ilford K0 nuclear       
 36S 7c  emulsion plates at the image surface of a three-stage magnetic         
 36S 8c  spectrograph (FWHM=25 keV). At extreme forward angles |q>2.5|', {+3}He 
 36S 9c  ions were detected using a 14|*50 mm position-sensitive detector.      
 36S Ac  Measured |s(E({+3}He),|q). Deduced levels, L-transfers, J, |p, and     
