 36CL2c  accelerator of Laboratori Nazionali di Legnaro. Target was 1 mg/cm{+2} 
 36CL3c  {+24}Mg (99.7% enriched). |g rays were detected with the 4|p-GASP array
 36CL4c  composed of 40 Compton-suppressed large-volume, HPGe detectors.        
