 36AR c  1976No03: E=7.9 and 8.7 MeV |a beams were produced at the Oliver Lodge 
 36AR2c  Laboratory. Target was enriched {+33}S. |g rays were detected with two 
 36AR3c  Ge(Li) detectors. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin, |g(|q), |g(lin pol),   
 36AR4c  recoil distances. Deduced levels, J, |p, lifetimes, |g-ray branching   
 36AR5c  ratios, multipolarities, mixing ratios, transition strenghts. See also 
 36AR6c  1973No03 for the lifetime measurement of 5171 level                    
 36AR d  1976No03 supersede 1974NoZS                                            
