 36AR3c  was 240 |mg/cm{+2} CdS (48% enriched in {+33}S). |g rays were detected 
 36AR4c  with a Ge(Li) detector and a plastic scintillator; neutrons were       
 36AR5c  detected with a TOF spectrometer consisting of 19 liquid scintillators.
 36AR6c  Measured E|g, I|g, n|g-coin. Deduced levels, J, |p, |g-ray branching   
 36AR7c  ratios. Comparisons with shell-model calculations.                     
