 36AR6cG E|g values are quoted as rounded values to the nearest keV.            
 36AR cG RI$From 1974Jo02, unless otherwise noted. Quoted values are branching  
 36AR2cG ratios from each level. The branching ratio of unidentified transitions
 36AR3cG of each resonance, if applicable, is given under comments at the       
 36AR4cG strongest primary transition.                                          
 36AR cG M,MR$From |g(|q) in 1973Ho33 and RUL where applicable, unless otherwise
 36AR2cG noted. RUL arguments are used to determine magnetic or electric        
 36AR3cG character when measured level T{-1/2} is available or when |G{-|g} of a
 36AR4cG resonance implied from measured S{-p|g} and |g branchings is           
 36AR5cG significant (e.g., |G{-|g}>0.1 eV corresponds to |g partial T{-1/2}<46 
 36AR6cG fs).                                                                   
 36AR cG E(X),RI(X)$|g reported in 1972Ho40 only; considered questionable by the
 36AR2cG evaluator                                                              
 36AR cG M(Y,Z),MR(Y)$From |g|g(|q) and |g(lin pol) in 1966Er06                 
 36AR cL $S{-p|g} values are for resonance strength defined as                  
 36AR2cL S{-p|g}=(2J+1)|G{-p}|G{-|g}/|G and are extracted from measured         
 36AR3cL resonance yields. Values are from 1974Jo02, unless otherwise noted.    
 36AR cL E$Values for bound states are from 1974Jo02 based on their measured E|g
 36AR2cL data (not explicitly listed) and values for resonance levels above that
 36AR3cL are deduced by the evaluator using E(level)=E{-p}(cm)+S(p)({+36}Ar),   
 36AR4cL where E{-p}(cm) is the proton resonance energy in the center-of-mass   
 36AR5cL frame and is deduced from E{-p}(lab) and S(p)=8506.98 {I4} for {+36}Ar 
 36AR6cL from 2021Wa16, unless otherwise noted. E{-p}(cm) is deduced from       
 36AR7cL E{-p}(cm)=E{-p}(lab)|*m({+35}Cl)/[m({+35}Cl)+m(p)], where m({+35}Cl)   
 36AR8cL and m(p) are the atomic masses of {+35}Cl and proton from 2021Wa16,    
 36AR9cL respectively. E{-p} values under comments are from 1974Jo02, unless    
 36ARAcL otherwise noted.                                                       
