 36AR4c  rays were detected with the TRIUMF-ISAC Gamma-Ray Escape Suppressed    
 36AR5c  Spectrometer (TIGRESS) containing 13 clover Ge detectors and charged   
 36AR6c  particles were detected with an 44-element silicon PIN diode array.    
